{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a sword-fighting VR game. Currently, it only features one weapon and two skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More items, skills, and gameplay mechanics will be added in the future. We also plan to incorporate RPG elements\u2014for example, the higher a weapon\u2019s stun value, the easier it will be to stun enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to create a loot-hunting game where you lead a team in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is still a work in progress, so there may be many rough edges right now. It will be updated continuously. If you have any issues or ideas, please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out\u2014I truly need everyone\u2019s feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, hope you have a great time playing!<br>QQ Group: 1043200185</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913490?t=1755111439","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913490?t=1755111439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913490/eb27e57ea5dd3ed4b1a6d3729dcd8642398e164d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755111439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913490/eb27e57ea5dd3ed4b1a6d3729dcd8642398e164d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755111439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a sword-fighting VR game. Currently, it only features one weapon and two skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More items, skills, and gameplay mechanics will be added in the future. We also plan to incorporate RPG elements\u2014for example, the higher a weapon\u2019s stun value, the easier it will be to stun enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to create a loot-hunting game where you lead a team in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is still a work in progress, so there may be many rough edges right now. It will be updated continuously. If you have any issues or ideas, please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out\u2014I truly need everyone\u2019s feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, hope you have a great time playing!<br>QQ Group: 1043200185</p>","developers":["Chubby Knight Workshop"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3867460","name":"Sword World VR"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913490/b021e6c4a8c743510ad93e4eeb33a7ff1d03be0f/header.jpg?t=1755111439","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175682,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175682/movie480.mp4?t=1755111437","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175682/movie_max.mp4?t=1755111437"},"name":"Sword World Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175682/fa543fab70455ed9cc80d65637103d2b405f0b73/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755111437","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175682/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755111437","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175682/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755111437"}}],"name":"Sword World VR Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Meta Quest2</li></ul>","re